===Check Dan Shu's message{{subst:void|<!--202010401-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=adventure|location=Artisanship Commission|The incident seems to have come to an end for now, but the matter with the Disciples of Sanctus Medicus is far from over. That genius chief alchemist in the Alchemy Commission is still looking into the Draught of Draconic Surge's pharmacology for you, but has delivered no findings so far. Better to leave the Artisanship Commission for now and wait for further contact in town.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}
{{Dialogue End}}

===Speak with Dan Shu at the Exalting Sanctum and learn about the Draught of Draconic Surge{{subst:void|<!--202010402-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=adventure|location=Exalting Sanctum|update|Dan Shu's study into the Draught of Draconic Surge managed to yield some information. She definitely deserves her title of being a genius chief alchemist, the breadth of her knowledge was jaw-droppingly vast.<br />Hand Dan Shu's report to Qingzu, she must need the report as quickly as possible.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}

;(Obtain {{Предмет|Pharmacological Studies on the Draught of Draconic Surge|20|x=1}})

;(Talk to Dan Shu)
:'''Dan Shu:''' Ah, you're back. From the sound of your stride, I sense you're in good spirits.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} You've got that right.
::'''Dan Shu:''' Many who undertake the far-reaching journey to the Xianzhou are weighed down by a heavy heart and exhaustion... but your steps are bold and steady - a stride worthy of a Nameless.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} You can tell just by listening?
::'''Dan Shu:''' A persons's footfall reveals a lot about their strength and emotions &mdash; much like how a person's breath may serve as an indication of their overall health.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Your ears are really sharp!
::'''Dan Shu:''' I wouldn't be envious. This is not an innate ability &mdash; merely compensation for my visual impairment. Ultimately, nothing I hear or smell can match the vividness of the colors that you perceive.
:'''Dan Shu:''' Let's get down to business... I analyzed the prescription you procured: The Draught of Draconic Surge. Now that I have a preliminary conclusion, it needs to be delivered to the Seat of Divine Foresight.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} What is the conclusion?
:'''Dan Shu:''' The conclusion... Put simply, I don't believe that the Draught of Draconic Surge holds the cure to the mara. Even in the foreseeable future, there will likely not be any such cure.
:'''Dan Shu:''' I've compiled the details into a written analysis. If you're interested, feel free to take a look.
:'''Dan Shu:''' This is a copy of "Pharmacological Studies on the Draught of Draconic Surge." If the chief counselor wants to see it urgently, I'll have to ask you to deliver it for me.
{{Dialogue End}}

===Head to the Seat of Divine Foresight and pass Dan Shu's report to Qingzu{{subst:void|<!--202010403-->}}===
