::'''Qingzu:''' Dan Shu? Wait &mdash; why would the Alchemy Commission's chief alchemist be away from her post?
::'''Qingzu:''' I've heard that the chief alchemist is visually impaired &mdash; she rarely leaves the Alchemy Commission delve. She has a vast knowledge and expertise &mdash; no wonder she was able to analyze the pharmacology so quickly.
::'''Qingzu:''' Let me see her report...
::'''Qingzu:''' No cure? Tsk, where did these villains get their hands on such a complex prescription? This is infuriating...
::'''Qingzu:''' Still, this is a clue we can follow. Thank you, (Trailblazer). Please accept these gifts for your efforts.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} You've already rewarded me.
:::'''Qingzu:''' Those were rewards from the Seat of Divine Foresight &mdash; these are gifts from me, personally. You've done so much for the Luofu... for the Xianzhou. This is the least I could do.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} You're being too polite.
:::'''Qingzu:''' Please, take them. You've done so much for the Luofu... for the Xianzhou. This is the least I could do.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Thank you~
:::'''Qingzu:''' Please, take them. You've done so much for the Luofu... for the Xianzhou. This is the least I could do.
:<pre>{
	"$type": "RPG.GameCore.PlayMessage",
