:'''Dan Shu:''' Everyone, everything is like a hot coal in the dark &mdash; invisible, yet still able to burn you.
:'''Dan Shu:''' As a long-life species, she can expect life to continue like this for nearly a thousand years. She must learn to depend upon herself rather than just foolishly waiting around for the next hero to swoop in and save her.
