===Go to the Spare Time Book Shop and wait for Dan Shu's message{{subst:void|<!--202010412-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=adventure|location=Exalting Sanctum|update|Dan Shu wants to give you something as a thank-you, but she needs some time to prepare. Come back later, and look around for some books at the Spare Time Book Shop. The book store seems to be quite lenient toward those who display no interest in purchasing anything.}}
